# Windsurf Cascade Engineering Rules

This repository is governed by `AGENTS.md` and `.agents/rules/` (`01` through `14`).

## Mandatory Engineering Standards
1. **Security & Privacy**: Zero hardcoded secrets; OWASP Web Top 10 + LLM Top 10 compliance; recursive PII redaction in logs (`01-security-and-owasp.md`, `14-data-privacy-and-compliance.md`).
2. **Clean Architecture & API Contracts**: Single-responsibility Command/Query Use-Case Handlers, Rich Domain Entities, `Result<T, E>` error handling, `/api/v1/` versioning, and RFC 7807 Problem Details (`03-architecture-and-code.md`, `12-api-design-and-versioning.md`).
3. **Database, CQRS, & Caching**: 3NF Command models, denormalized Read projections, RFC 9562 UUIDv7 keys, `version` optimistic locking, scoped `Idempotency-Key` middleware, Jittered TTL caching, and `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED` worker claims (`04-database-and-cqrs.md`, `13-caching-and-rate-limiting.md`).
4. **Resiliency & Observability**: Transactional Outbox, LIFO Saga Orchestrator, Rolling-Window Circuit Breaker with Full Jitter, Graceful `SIGTERM` Shutdown (`/livez`, `/readyz`), and single-line NDJSON logs correlated with W3C `trace_id` via `AsyncLocalStorage` (`05-observability-otel.md`, `08-devops-and-iac.md`, `10-monolith-vs-microservices.md`).
5. **Frontend & Complexity**: Solid tactile surfaces (no `backdrop-blur`), State Triad (TanStack Query, `nuqs`, Zustand), RHF + Zod, structural skeletons ($\text{CLS} < 0.1$), $O(1)$ `Map`/`Set` lookups in loops, and explicit Arrange-Act-Assert (AAA) tests (`02-ui-ux-human-craft.md`, `06-testing-strategy.md`, `09-frontend-engineering.md`, `11-computational-complexity-and-metrics.md`).
6. **Verification Gate**: Always run `./.agents/hooks/scripts/harness-verify.sh` before completing any task.
